WHAT THE GENERATION PIPELINE ACTUALLY USES

  SHARP (Apple Machine Learning Research)
      Local single-image reconstruction. Apple ML Research license.
      Downloaded during backend setup.

  Marble (World Labs)
      Optional cloud generation, called with the user's own API key.
      Governed by World Labs' terms of service; usage is billed to the
      key holder, not to this project.

RETIRED, BUT STILL PRESENT AS BACKEND ENDPOINTS

The foreground-object pipeline was removed from generation. Its endpoints
remain in backend/server.py and load lazily, so these models are only
fetched or run if something calls them directly.

  SAM 2 / SAM 3 (Meta)      Meta's SAM license. SAM 3 weights are gated and
                            commercial use is restricted — this needs a legal
                            read before any hosted offering.
  TripoSR (Stability AI)    MIT, per the model card.
  LaMa (Samsung AI)         Apache-2.0.
  AudioLDM (CVSSP)          Check the current model card on Hugging Face.

